135:### Phase 26: Migration, Export, Backup, and Restore
136-**Goal**: Users can move, preserve, and restore Wayland state without executing imported content or leaking secrets.
137-**Depends on**: Phase 23
138-**Requirements**: F26-01, F26-02, F26-03, F26-04, F26-05
139-**Success Criteria** (what must be TRUE):
140-  1. Hermes/OpenClaw discovery and dry-run are typed, deterministic, secret-redacted, and non-mutating.
141-  2. Selective import/export preserves provenance and quarantines executable content.
